    heading: "agentsessionlifecycle",
    content: "`StatusIdle`, `StatusStarting`, `StatusRunning`, `StatusStopping`, `StatusStopped`, and `StatusError` are deprecated aliases of these constants. `agentkit.SessionStatus` is a different type: the agent status returned by the REST API endpoint that lists agents."
